/**
 * SeriesSum provides a utility to compute the sum of the series
 * 1² + 2² + 3² + … + n².
 *
 * The class follows the “static factory method” advice: instead of exposing
 * a public constructor, we expose a static factory method named {@code valueOf}
 * (see ITEM 1 of the programming advice).  This makes the intent clear and
 * gives a consistent naming convention.
 */
public class SeriesSum {

    // Private constructor – prevents direct instantiation
    private SeriesSum() {
