class VolumeTetrahedron {
    /**
     * Calculates the volume of a regular tetrahedron whose edge length is `num`.
     *
     * The volume of a regular tetrahedron with edge length a is:
     *     V = a^3 / (6 * sqrt(2))
     *
     * The result is rounded to two decimal places (half‑up).
     *
     * > volumeTetrahedron(10)
     * 117.85
     * > volumeTetrahedron(15)
