 * 1² + 2² + 3² + … + n².
 */
class SeriesSum {

    /**
     * Calculates the sum of squares from 1² up to n².
     *
     * @param number the upper bound of the series (must be non‑negative)
     * @return the sum of squares 1² + 2² + … + number²
