 *
 * The volume of a regular tetrahedron with edge length {@code a} is
 * {@code a³·√2 / 12}.
 *
 * The method is intentionally static and stateless, adhering to the
 * principle of immutability (Item 17 in Effective Java).
 */
public class VolumeTetrahedron {

