 *
 * <p>The series is: 1² + 2² + 3² + … + n²</p>
 *
 * <p>Example:
 * <pre>
 * seriesSum(6) → 91
 * seriesSum(7) → 140
 * seriesSum(12) → 650
 * </pre></p>
 *
 * @author  (your name)
 * @version 1.0
 */
class SeriesSum {

    /**
     * Calculates the sum of the series 1² + 2² + … + n².
     *
     * <p>This implementation uses the closed‑form formula
     * {@code n * (n + 1) * (2n + 1) / 6} which runs in O(1) time.</p>
     *
     * @param number the number of terms in the series (must be non‑negative)
     * @return the sum of the squares of the first {@code number} natural numbers
     */
    public static int seriesSum(int number) {
