     * for the given square matrix of size n*n.
     *
     * A path starts at the top‑left cell (0,0) and ends at the bottom‑right
     * cell (n‑1,n‑1), moving only right or down. The average of a path is
     * (sum of the cell values on the path) / (2*n‑1).
     *
     * @param cost  the n×n matrix of integer costs
     * @param n     the dimension of the square matrix
     * @return      the maximum possible average, or null if the input is invalid
