class VolumeTetrahedron {
    /**
     * Calculates the volume of a regular tetrahedron given the length of its edge.
     *
     * The volume V of a regular tetrahedron with edge length a is:
     *     V = a³ / (6·√2)
     *
     * @param num the length of an edge (the side of the tetrahedron)
