 * of the first n natural numbers: 1² + 2² + 3² + … + n².
 */
class SeriesSum {

    /**
     * Calculates the sum of the series 1² + 2² + … + n².
     *
     * @param number the number of terms (must be non‑negative)
     * @return the sum of squares of the first {@code number} natural numbers;
     *         returns 0 for non‑positive input.
     *
     * <p>Examples:
     * <ul>
     *   <li>seriesSum(6) → 91</li>
     *   <li>seriesSum(7) → 140</li>
     *   <li>seriesSum(12) → 650</li>
