/**
 * Utility class for computing the volume of a regular tetrahedron.
 *
 * <p>The volume V of a regular tetrahedron whose edge length is {@code a} is
 * given by the formula:</p>
 *
 * <blockquote>
 * V = a³ / (6·√2)
 * </blockquote>
 *
 * <p>Example usage:</p>
 * <pre>
 * double v = VolumeTetrahedron.volumeTetrahedron(10); // ≈ 117.85
