     * Counts characters that are not vowels and have at least one vowel
     * as an immediate neighbour (left or right).
     *
     * @param testStr the input string
     * @return the number of such characters
     *
     * > countVowels("bestinstareels")
     * 7
     * > countVowels("partofthejourneyistheend")
