     * cell and ends at the lower‑right cell of the given n×n matrix.
     * Movement is restricted to right or down steps.
     *
     * @param cost the n×n matrix of integer costs
     * @param n    the dimension of the square matrix
     * @return the maximum average as a {@code Double}, or {@code null} if the
     *         input is invalid
